  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The legal dispute centers on the ritualistic lighting of the Karthigai Deepam lamp at the hill temple in Tirupparankundram, Madurai. This traditional practice has become the subject of intense scrutiny following disagreements between state authorities and temple management over the implementation of Supreme Court orders. The issue involves questions regarding the management of religious rites and the extent of administrative oversight by the state government versus independent temple boards. Tensions have risen as various public figures and media commentators have weighed in on the significance of the ritual and the potential implications of the ongoing legal challenges. The matter is now slated for review by the Supreme Court, which will examine the petitions filed to address the escalating conflict surrounding the conduct of the Deepathoon ceremony at this site.",
